    <p>Reliable knowledge and training data cutoff: January 2026. Parameter count, FLOPs, dataset mix, and any RLHF / RLVR / RLAIF recipe tied to this SKU: UNKNOWN.</p>

    <h2 class="ai-model-section">Inference</h2>
    <p>Adaptive thinking. Default effort is high. Latency class is fast relative to the current Claude lineup.</p>

    <h2 class="ai-model-section">Context</h2>
    <p>1M token context window. 128K max output tokens. Modalities: text and image in, text out; multilingual; vision; tool use.</p>

